V_\psi^*-V_\psi(\widehat f_{n,1},\widehat f_{n,2})\leq C\max\left\{(1+x)^2(\log n)^2\left(\frac{\rho_n\log A_n}{n}\right)^{\frac{1+\alpha}{2+\alpha}},\mathit{Opt}_n\right\}
